resend_countdown} sebagai placeholder untuk angka hitung mundur pengiriman ulang.','Maximum OTP Verification Attempts'=>'Maksimum Percobaan Verifikasi OTP','Limits the number of OTP verification attempts on the frontend. Once the maximum limit is reached, the field will be locked until the page is reloaded.'=>'Membatasi jumlah percobaan verifikasi OTP di frontend. Setelah batas maksimum tercapai, field akan dikunci sampai halaman dimuat ulang.','OTP Expiration Time (Minutes)'=>'Waktu Kadaluarsa OTP (Menit)','How long the OTP remains valid in minutes. The expiration is verified on the server during form submission.'=>'Berapa lama OTP tetap berlaku dalam menit. Kadaluarsa diverifikasi di server saat pengiriman formulir.','Defines how long the OTP remains valid. The expiration is verified on the server during form submission.'=>'Menentukan berapa lama OTP tetap berlaku. Masa kedaluwarsa diverifikasi di server saat pengiriman formulir.','When enabled, the OTP will be automatically sent if the user attempts to submit the form or move to the next step without clicking "Send OTP" first.'=>'Jika diaktifkan, OTP akan dikirim secara otomatis jika pengguna mencoba mengirim formulir atau melanjutkan ke langkah berikutnya tanpa mengklik "Kirim OTP" terlebih dahulu.','Automatically Send OTP on Validation'=>'Kirim OTP Otomatis saat Validasi','When enabled, OTP verification is triggered automatically once the user has entered all digits (via typing, pasting, or autofill).'=>'Jika diaktifkan, verifikasi OTP akan dipicu secara otomatis setelah pengguna memasukkan semua digit (melalui pengetikan, menempel, atau pengisian otomatis).','Automatically Verify OTP on Input'=>'Verifikasi OTP Otomatis saat Input','OTP Code Length'=>'Panjang Kode OTP','Set how many digits the OTP code will contain. Accepted range: 4 – 8.'=>'Tentukan berapa banyak digit yang akan dimiliki kode OTP. Rentang yang diterima: 4 – 8.','Allowed range: 4 to 8 digits.'=>'Rentang yang diizinkan: 4 sampai 8 digit.','OTP Resend Delay (Seconds)'=>'Penundaan Kirim Ulang OTP (Detik)','Sets the waiting time (in seconds) before the "Resend OTP" button becomes active again.'=>'Mengatur waktu tunggu (dalam detik) sebelum tombol "Kirim Ulang OTP" aktif kembali.','Email Template'=>'Template Email','Available placeholders: ${bf_otp_code}, ${bf_expiry_minutes}'=>'Placeholder yang tersedia: ${bf_otp_code}, ${bf_expiry_minutes}','Note: To send OTP emails, SMTP must be configured on your site. You can set it up in Bit Form'=>'Catatan: Untuk mengirim email OTP, SMTP harus dikonfigurasi di situs Anda. Anda dapat mengaturnya di Bit Form','section.'=>'bagian.','Edit OTP Email Template'=>'Sunting Template Email OTP','Placeholders: ${bf_otp_code} — the OTP code, ${bf_expiry_minutes} — expiry time in minutes'=>'Placeholder: ${bf_otp_code} — kode OTP, ${bf_expiry_minutes} — waktu kedaluwarsa dalam menit','Email OTP Receiver Email is missing'=>'Email Penerima OTP Email hilang','Receiver Email'=>'Email Penerima','The email address where the OTP will be sent. Choose "Dynamic" to use an Email field from your form, or "Static" to enter a fixed address.'=>'Alamat email tempat OTP akan dikirim. Pilih "Dinamis" untuk menggunakan kolom Email dari formulir Anda, atau "Statis" untuk memasukkan alamat tetap.','Dynamic (Email Field)'=>'Dinamis (Kolom Email)','Static (Fixed Email)'=>'Statik (Email Tetap)','Email Address'=>'Alamat Email','Enter a email here..'=>'Masukkan email di sini..','-- Select Email Field --'=>'-- Pilih Kolom Email --','Mollie Description is Required'=>'Deskripsi Mollie Wajib Diisi','Select Account'=>'Pilih Akun','Razorpay Dynamic Amount Field is not Selected'=>'Field Jumlah Dinamis Razorpay Tidak Dipilih','Rating Icon'=>'Ikon Penilaian','Rounded'=>'Membulat','Min/Max Text Length:'=>'Panjang Teks Min/Maks:','Min Length:'=>'Panjang Min:','By enabling this feature, user will see the error message when input length is less than'=>'Dengan mengaktifkan fitur ini, pengguna akan melihat pesan kesalahan sa